+## Testing one score at a time
+
+`history_selection.evaluate_history_candidates` produces prediction scores and
+ordering keys from frozen history models. `rank_history_candidates` applies the
+existing eligibility and ordering policy to those evaluated records. A saved
+history artifact permits ranking trials without fitting or re-evaluating
+residuals. `fit_stage.fit_ellipse_dataset` and
+`planning_pass.plan_ellipse_sweep` likewise separate fitting from movement
+ranking. These boundaries do not redefine any objective or acceptance score.
