 oldest inserted entry when full. Keys are not rounded, so even small parameter
 changes produce a separate transformation.
 
+Each new modeled dataset copies the dictionaries whose lengths are rewritten
+and the configuration. Fitting borrows unmodified nested encoder/noise metadata
+as read-only, avoiding repeated deep copies. The public transformation helper
+retains full-copy isolation by default.
+
 Repeated parameters reuse the same dataset object. This also enables the
 existing cost-function cache and residual-evaluation cache to hit; residual
 evaluations additionally require the same exact anchor vector.
